"user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u0026gt; Vim-plug is a minimalist Vim plugin manager with many features like on-demand plugin loading and parallel updating, available as vim-plugAUR or vim-plug-gitAUR.\n\u0026gt; Vundle is available as vundleAUR or vundle-gitAUR.\n\u0026gt; pathogen.vim is a simple plugin for managing Vim's runtimepath, available as vim-pathogenAUR or vim-pathogen-gitAUR.\n\u0026gt; Dein.vim is a plugin manager replacing NeoBundle, available as vim-deinAUR or vim-dein-gitAUR.\n急に時代が進んでる","ts":"1620874164.141000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2VQL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56897579-a0a2-41ef-a512-0d9a62be5c04","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おお、さすがだ \u0026gt; archwikiのdein説明","ts":"1620874145.140500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G6Od"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12832b17-9e6d-4ab9-9d0b-be292c2a823c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"プラグインマネージャがNeobundleになってるのが、はてって感じでしたっけ。(そういえば前も話に出した気がする)","ts":"1620874102.139900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gspJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"638a4c07-cc9f-43d4-9ea2-9adc0b7b900b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Vimのも。(Vimは網羅度は良く分からない。)\n\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/Vim\u003e","ts":"1620874035.139500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZujb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f650e73d-2f8f-4bcf-b80b-76fd6cdfeb05","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/Emacs\u003e\nEmacsのArch wiki、結構ちゃんとまとまってるんですよねー。","ts":"1620873999.139300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bcQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0653d79-5adb-4586-9461-596597d31ca9","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"なんかのOSSで